	"machinesSource": "The TMs each game's shops sell for money, by move, with their price: Generations 1-4 from the pret disassemblies (pokered marts.asm / tm_prices.asm, pokecrystal marts.asm / attributes.asm, pokeemerald and pokeruby Lilycove Department Store 4F, pokefirered Celadon Department Store 2F, pokeplatinum mart_items.h Veilstone Department Store 3F standing for Diamond / Pearl, pokeheartgold scrcmd_mart.c Goldenrod 5F and Celadon 3F); later games from Serebii Pokearth shop tables. Left out: shops of one version only (Emerald's Slateport market, Black 2 / White 2's Striaton City, Ultra Sun / Ultra Moon's lists - Sun / Moon's are kept), Battle Points, coins, Watts and League Points shops; Scarlet / Violet sells no TM for money. shops = the PokéTale shop kinds that sell them: a department store in Generations 1-4 (the games' department stores), both kinds from Generation 5 on (the games sell them at Poké Mart counters too). tools/build-shop.mjs reads the moves with each game's disc table (story/item-info.mjs machinesOf) and stops when a move is not on one of its TMs.",
